      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1838, Bluffton became the county seat of Wells County on March 5 of that same year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.blufftonindiana.gov/253/History-of-Bluffton",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When the railroad arrived in 1869, it drained nearby swamps and cut malaria risks, boosting local prosperity.",
