      ],
      "source": "https://www.blufftonindiana.gov/253/History-of-Bluffton",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Downtown Bluffton greets visitors with the historic Wells County Courthouse and the new Parlor City Plaza.",
